-- Scoped-global folds +/ */ &/ |/ #/: one scalar per query (ex14). Twin of 14-reductions.bqn.
-- The four trailing queries pin the empty-scope identities over None (the .bqn's none mask, 8 zeros): +/ is 0, */ is 1, &/ is 1, |/ is 0 — the identity, never an error.
-- Omitted here, left to the .bqn twin: the gather-order equivariance checks (fold of reversed gather).
--! registry 14-reductions

--! out 150
+/ Gold @ Nord

--! out 0.09375
*/ (1 - Resist) @ Hits

--! out 1
&/ Alive @ Party

--! out 1
|/ Burning @ Forest

-- entity 3 is Nord but TwoHanded=60 fails the strict >
--! out 2
#/ (Nord & TwoHanded > 60)

-- empty scope: the registered identities
--! out 0
+/ Gold @ None

--! out 1
*/ (1 - Resist) @ None

--! out 1
&/ Alive @ None

--! out 0
|/ Burning @ None
